# Store texts that NEVER ship in the tarball's licenses-binary/
# directory (requirement 13, emitter in generate-archive-manifest.py;
# staleness gate in check-asset-manifest.py). These are resolve-store
# generics: the R5/R6 resolution store keeps them for license-NAME
# lookup, but LICENSE-binary does not reference them per component, so
# the R13 emitter skips them and the R53 staleness gate does not demand
# a manifest reference. One slug per line. A slug listed here must not
# carry a licenses-binary-aliases row.
#
# apache-2.0: the Apache text is the manifest template itself.
# go: Google's plain Go license; kept for name resolution ("The Go
#   license" name resolves here) — the re2j component ships its own
#   RE2-derived text (texts/LICENSE-re2j.txt).
# json: the JSON.org text; no component currently ships under it (the
#   'json' word inside the javax.json coordinate would otherwise
#   falsely match).
# lgpl-2.1, mpl-1.1, w3c: no component currently ships under these.
apache-2.0
go
json
lgpl-2.1
mpl-1.1
w3c
